    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You summon a group of helpful spirits that last for the duration. They look like homunculi or another Construct of your choice, but they are intangible and invulnerable, and they count as proficient in the Arcana skill and with the Artisan’s Tools used to cast the spell.</p><p>When you craft an item, the spirits act as a single assistant, halving the crafting time.</p>",
